</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Breathe on us, Lord of life.</l><l>Until our hearts are pure,</l><l>Until with Thee we will one will,</l><l>To do or to endure.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Breathe on us, Lord of life,</l><l>Till we are wholly Thine,</l><l>Till all this earthly part of us</l><l>Glows with Thy fire divine.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Breathe on us, Lord of life,</l><l>So shall we never die,</l><l>But live with Thee the perfect life</l><l>Of Thine eternity.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
